# Domain counts basic land TYPES among lands you control (CR 205.3i): Tundra (Plains Island) and Bayou (Swamp Forest) give four,
# so Leyline Binding costs {1}{W}, paid with exactly those two lands (nothing floats afterwards). Bot2's Mountains
# do not count: with them the cost would have been lower still. It has flash, so Bot1 casts it during Bot2's turn 4, once the Ornithopter that Bot2 has just cast has resolved, and its trigger exiles that.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tundra
Bayou
Leyline Binding
Swamp
Tundra x2
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Ornithopter
Mountain x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Activate(Ability: {W})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou.Activate(Ability: {B})
Bot1.Hand.Leyline Binding.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield = Tundra; Bayou; Leyline Binding
